        A FOURTH THING, separate from dead globs but found by the same scan and belonging with the
        validation work: jpegxl-rs.work.arch-phase4e-modular-effort-ramp/1's scope contains
        double-wrapped glob strings — the stored value is literally the text `path "JPXL/crates/jpxl-
        cli/**"`, quotes and keyword included. AKR parsed it, stored it, and never objected. Malformed
