        WHAT THE NEXT SESSION MUST DECIDE.

        1. Whether a completed record's scope is still a claim. If it is, G023 must keep reporting after
        completion, and 88 occurrences appear at once. If it is not, say so in the docs, because every
        agent in this run assumed it was.

        2. Stop inferring intent from .gitignore. Make the predicate `git ls-files` for every scope path
        and watch glob — which is what AKR-G023's own message already promises, "matches no tracked
