                An oversized knowledge.get with detail canonical continues at detail body,
                which still includes acceptance checks, not at summary.
                """
            method command
            command "cargo test -p akr-mcp budget"
            verified_by [ @akr.evidence.papercuts-2026-08-27/1 ]
        }
        check l002-names-and-heals {
            statement """
                AKR-L002 names the edge-less revisions, and `akr revise` on a live head
                whose predecessors lack supersedes back-edges writes those edges on the
                successor.
                """
